      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Most definitely. If a user in a community is \"trusted\" there should be an exception list for those users to still be able to participate.\n\nOf course, asking such a thing requires VRC to be willing to put the effort in to implement that, as well as that they aren't just reallly wanting your data with this being the continued slow boil for you to fork your info over.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
